<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>主体思维 on Yousa Driven Development | YDD</title><link>https://yousali.com/tags/%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E6%80%9D%E7%BB%B4/</link><description>Recent content in 主体思维 on Yousa Driven Development | YDD</description><generator>Hugo -- 0.148.1</generator><language>zh</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:33:45 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://yousali.com/tags/%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E6%80%9D%E7%BB%B4/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>被贬杭州遇大饥荒，范仲淹偏要赛龙舟修寺庙</title><link>https://yousali.com/stories/fan-zhongyan-exile-governance/</link><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yousali.com/stories/fan-zhongyan-exile-governance/</guid><description>新政失败外放地方后，范仲淹在1050年吴中大饥荒中借竞渡宴游与兴修土木稳住杭州，也顶住了监司的弹劾。</description></item><item><title>跑七八百个剧组被拒后，张颂文在顺义菜市场一逛十几年</title><link>https://yousali.com/stories/zhang-songwen-market-notes/</link><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yousali.com/stories/zhang-songwen-market-notes/</guid><description>无戏可拍的十几年里，张颂文住顺义农家院、傍晚买便宜菜，把菜市场摊贩与街坊的日常细节攒进了后来的角色里。</description></item><item><title>师傅不教只让拧热毛巾，小野二郎靠偷看熬出九年学徒期</title><link>https://yousali.com/stories/jiro-ono-apprentice-craft/</link><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yousali.com/stories/jiro-ono-apprentice-craft/</guid><description>从7岁在福田屋打杂到25岁进东京与志乃学徒，小野二郎在师傅不开口的厨房里靠偷看刀工与火候攒下做寿司的手艺。</description></item></channel></rss>